{{<html}}
{{$main}}

{{& page.contents.html}}

<section class="hero primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <img
            src="{{baseUrl}}/images/logos/logo~dark.png"
            alt="Logo of {{site.name}}"
            title="{{site.name}}"
            >
        <p>Binary Birds</p>
        <h1>Software for the agentic era</h1>
        <p>We help businesses find the right uses for AI agents<br>and turn them into working software.</p>
        <a class="button" href="mailto:info@binarybirds.com">Let's talk</a>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="primary home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h2>Good software starts with quality</h2>
            <p>AI is changing the way software is made and the systems businesses depend on. We work with you to decide where it can help, build around the way your team works, and deliver something people can use.</p>
            <p>We help you shape the idea, understand the tradeoffs, and decide what to build first. Then the same team can take it from plan to production.</p>
            <p>We build software around your business, with a clear structure your team can understand and extend as your needs change.</p>
        </header>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="services competences primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h2>From planning to delivery, end to end</h2>
            <p>Our team brings product management, consulting, and software development together. We can help you plan a new product, build it, or improve a system that is already in use.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-321">
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 4.5h-3A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 6.75v12A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 5.25 21h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 21 18.75v-12a2.25 2.25 0 0 0-2.25-2.25h-3M8.25 4.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25-2.25h3a2.25 2.25 0 0 1 2.25 2.25M8.25 4.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25 2.25h3a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25M8 12h8m-8 4h5" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Product planning</h3>
                <p>Clarify requirements, validate ideas, and choose a sensible path from first version to long-term product.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m8.25 8.25-3.75 3.75 3.75 3.75m7.5-7.5 3.75 3.75-3.75 3.75m-3-9-1.5 10.5" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Custom software</h3>
                <p>Build backend services, websites, and native apps for Apple platforms and Android, shaped around your users.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M20.25 11.25c0 4.142-3.694 7.5-8.25 7.5-1.122 0-2.189-.204-3.15-.57L3.75 20.25l1.425-4.275A7.2 7.2 0 0 1 3.75 11.25c0-4.142 3.694-7.5 8.25-7.5s8.25 3.358 8.25 7.5Z" />
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 10.5h.008v.008H8.25V10.5Zm3.75 0h.008v.008H12V10.5Zm3.75 0h.008v.008h-.008V10.5Z" />
                </svg>
                <h3>Technical consulting</h3>
                <p>Get practical help with architecture, delivery, and the technical decisions that keep a project moving.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h2>We build and use our own tools</h2>
            <p>We build our own tools and infrastructure to keep the software we deliver fast, affordable to run, reliable, and secure. By choosing and controlling the foundations ourselves, we can focus on delivering the best quality for each project.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-321">
            <div class="card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/feather-cms-logo.png" alt="Feather CMS logo">
                <h3>Feather CMS</h3>
                <p>Our open-source Swift CMS, built for teams that want to shape the system around their product.</p>
                <p><a href="https://feathercms.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/feather-framework-logo.png" alt="Feather Framework logo">
                <h3>Feather Framework</h3>
                <p>Reusable Swift components for common backend work.</p>
                <p><a href="https://feather-framework.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <img class="medium" src="{{baseUrl}}/images/footer/toucan-logo.png" alt="Toucan logo">
                <h3>Toucan</h3>
                <p>A Swift static site generator for fast websites with a straightforward content workflow.</p>
                <p><a href="https://toucansites.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Learn more →</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <header class="centered">
            <p>Feather and Toucan are part of our day-to-day work. Building them keeps our engineering grounded in real product needs, and lets us bring that experience to the products we make with clients.</p>
            <p>Our experience with modular systems and explicit API contracts gives AI coding agents a codebase they can work with alongside our team.</p>
            <a class="button" href="https://github.com/binarybirds/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See our work on GitHub</a>
        </header>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="primary home-black">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h2>What our clients say</h2>
            <p>We work closely with our clients and take responsibility for the work we deliver.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="grid grid-221">
            {{#context.testimonials}}
                {{> partials.testimonial}}
            {{/context.testimonials}}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-us home-gray">
    <div class="wrapper">
        <header>
            <h2>Have a project in mind?</h2>
            <p>Tell us what you are working on. We would be happy to talk it through.</p>
        </header>
        <div>
            <p>Send us an e-mail at info@binarybirds.com.</p>
            <a class="button" href="mailto:info@binarybirds.com">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{{/main}}
{{/html}}
